hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"180","[AI-translation] Hamain al-Abbas bin Muhammad ad-Duri ne hadith bayan ki, kehne lage: hamain Yunus bin Muhammad ne hadith bayan ki, kehne lage: hamain Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne hadith bayan ki, Uthman bin Abd ar-Rahman se, Yaqub bin Abi Yaqub se, Umm al-Mundhir se. Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam mere paas tashreef laye, aur unke saath Ali the, aur hamare paas kachi khajoorein latak rahi thin. Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam khaane lage aur Ali bhi unke saath khaane lage, toh Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Ali se farmaya: Bas karo ya Ali, kyunke tum oontni ho. Unhon ne kaha: Ali baith gaye, aur Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam khaate rahe. Unhon ne kaha: Maine unke liye palak aur jau tayyar kiya, toh Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Ali se farmaya: Is mein se kha lo, kyunke yeh tumhare liye behtar hai."
"181","[AI-translation] Hamain Mahmud bin Ghaylan ne hadith bayan ki, kehne lage: hamain Bishr bin as-Sarri ne hadith bayan ki, Sufyan se, Talha bin Yahya se, Aisha bint Talha se, Aisha Umm al-Mu'minin se. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam mere paas tashreef layate aur farmate: Kya tumhare paas khaana hai? Toh main kehti: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Toh farmate: Main roza hoon. Unhon ne kaha: Ek din wo mere paas aaye, toh main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, hamain ek tohfa bheja gaya hai. Farmaya: Wo kya hai? Maine kaha: Hais. Farmaya: Beshak main roza hoon. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhone kha liya."
"182","[AI-translation] Hamain Abdullah bin Abd ar-Rahman ne hadith bayan ki, kehne lage: hamain Umar bin Hafs bin Ghiyath ne hadith bayan ki, kehne lage: hamain mere walid ne hadith bayan ki, Muhammad bin Abi Yahya al-Aslami se, Yazid bin Abi Umayya al-A'war se, Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam se. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko dekha ke unhon ne jau ki roti ka ek tukda uthaya, us par ek khajoor rakhi aur farmaya: Yeh is ki chatni hai, aur kha gaye."
